      "code": "TreeNode * search(TreeNode * node, int key)\n{\n    if (node == NULL) return NULL;\n    if (key == node->key) return node;\n    else if (key < node->key)\n        return search(node->left, key);\n    else\n        return search(node->right, key);\n}",
